### API del e-commerce — colección de requests (REST Client / IntelliJ HTTP).
### Requiere el backend en http://localhost:8080 (ver SKILL.md).
### Los endpoints /api/* se implementan en la Fase 1; por ahora solo responde /actuator.

@host = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Health
GET {{host}}/actuator/health

### 2. Catálogo (HU1)
GET {{host}}/api/products

### 3. Quote — happy path con WELCOME2026 (HU2)
POST {{host}}/api/checkout/quote
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    { "productId": 1, "quantity": 1 },
    { "productId": 2, "quantity": 2 },
    { "productId": 6, "quantity": 4 }
  ],
  "couponCode": "WELCOME2026"
}

### 4. Quote — sin cupón
POST {{host}}/api/checkout/quote
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [ { "productId": 1, "quantity": 1 } ]
}

### 5. Quote — cupón inexistente (se ignora)
POST {{host}}/api/checkout/quote
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [ { "productId": 1, "quantity": 1 } ],
  "couponCode": "NOEXISTE"
}

### 6. Quote — cupón expirado (se ignora)
POST {{host}}/api/checkout/quote
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [ { "productId": 1, "quantity": 1 } ],
  "couponCode": "BLACKFRIDAY2025"
}

### 7. Quote — carrito vacío (400/422)
POST {{host}}/api/checkout/quote
Content-Type: application/json

{ "items": [] }

### 8. Quote — cantidad inválida (400)
POST {{host}}/api/checkout/quote
Content-Type: application/json

{ "items": [ { "productId": 1, "quantity": -2 } ] }

### 9. Checkout — happy path (HU3)
POST {{host}}/api/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    { "productId": 1, "quantity": 1 },
    { "productId": 6, "quantity": 4 }
  ],
  "couponCode": "WELCOME2026",
  "customerUsername": "ana"
}

### 10. Checkout — stock insuficiente (409). productId 4 = "Auriculares Bluetooth", stock 3
POST {{host}}/api/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [ { "productId": 4, "quantity": 99 } ],
  "customerUsername": "ana"
}

### 11. Detalle de una orden (reemplazar el radicado por el del paso 9)
GET {{host}}/api/orders/ORD-00000000000000000

### 12a. Pseudo-login OK
GET {{host}}/api/customers/ana

### 12b. Pseudo-login KO (404)
GET {{host}}/api/customers/nadie

### 13. Compras del cliente
GET {{host}}/api/customers/ana/orders

### 14. Avanzar estado de la orden (reemplazar el radicado)
PATCH {{host}}/api/orders/ORD-00000000000000000/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "ENVIADO" }
